WEBVTT

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:10.094
Like a tiny fool,

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:13.014
they died in futile battle.

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:15.725
That is the way of the world.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:19.228
Worthy of little more than pity.

00:00:21.731 --> 00:00:23.900
They coveted a vast power,

00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:25.943
and they wailed.

00:00:27.695 --> 00:00:28.487
However,

00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:30.615
I do not understand.

00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:36.037
What is this vast power?

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:39.582
Why did you take flight,
searching for it?

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:45.087
Will avenging you...

00:00:47.882 --> 00:00:50.509
...reveal something to me,

00:00:53.638 --> 00:00:56.140
Village of Jestful Slumber, Mare?

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:29.924
<i>Now set free</i>

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:36.305
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:01:36.514 --> 00:01:40.184
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:01:40.393 --> 00:01:46.232
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.776
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:01:48.985 --> 00:01:51.404
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.948
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:58.828
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:01.372
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.041
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.669
<i>Your existence</i>

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:11.757
<i>Cry out</i>

00:02:11.966 --> 00:02:14.176
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:14.552 --> 00:02:16.929
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:17.138 --> 00:02:19.515
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:02:19.724 --> 00:02:27.565
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:34.155
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:48.252
I'll let you go on ahead, Nietono.

00:02:48.461 --> 00:02:49.837
Yeah, farewell.

00:02:50.046 --> 00:02:51.422
Good fortune.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.840
Yeah.

00:02:58.971 --> 00:03:00.806
Synchronization.

00:03:09.148 --> 00:03:10.983
I see it.

00:03:24.288 --> 00:03:25.706
Good...

00:03:44.433 --> 00:03:47.436
Destruction Blade Sabrac is a terrifying foe.

00:03:49.105 --> 00:03:53.526
He was thought to have
been eliminated in Misaki City,

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:57.279
by splitting his body,
which was blended with the entire city,

00:03:57.488 --> 00:04:01.325
from his consciousness,
housed in a humanoid form, indeed.

00:04:02.368 --> 00:04:03.786
However...

00:04:08.874 --> 00:04:10.876
His survival is a threat.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.851
So the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed
Slayer escaped my grasp...

00:04:27.726 --> 00:04:29.478
She broke free of captivity,

00:04:29.687 --> 00:04:33.149
bringing the other slayers.

00:04:33.357 --> 00:04:35.818
Since they were expecting me,

00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:38.529
that attack resulted
in no more than a scratch.

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:42.324
Nothing goes the way you want.

00:05:19.695 --> 00:05:21.363
We've made it so far?

00:05:21.572 --> 00:05:24.033
We have arrived at this shrine?

00:05:24.533 --> 00:05:26.911
Things appear to be in motion already.

00:05:27.119 --> 00:05:30.664
Everyone is in a hurry.

00:05:30.873 --> 00:05:33.959
We can't see the battle outside from here.

00:05:34.168 --> 00:05:36.754
I'd like to finish as soon as
possible, and leave.

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:40.132
What nonsense!

00:05:40.341 --> 00:05:43.636
We've made our way into such a treasury!

00:05:43.844 --> 00:05:46.138
We can't just leave!

00:05:46.347 --> 00:05:49.058
M-M-Madness!

00:05:52.186 --> 00:05:52.978
Yeah,

00:05:53.187 --> 00:05:56.232
there really isn't time for talk.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.107
Indeed.

00:05:57.316 --> 00:06:01.654
His speeches are long,
even at the best of times.

00:06:05.616 --> 00:06:08.160
Aged tuner...

00:06:08.369 --> 00:06:13.499
Time and chance have never
brought us together in combat.

00:06:13.707 --> 00:06:18.128
But this time, it seems I'll
be able to witness the Destroyer.

00:06:23.759 --> 00:06:26.345
You old guys are just
too hard to keep up with!

00:06:26.554 --> 00:06:27.346
It makes me lose self-confidence!

00:06:27.555 --> 00:06:29.723
You'll have your chance to regain it.

00:06:29.932 --> 00:06:33.060
Yeah, just to let you know,

00:06:33.269 --> 00:06:35.771
it seems I can't use my
Ceremonial Equipment here.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.314
Oh, huh.

00:06:37.523 --> 00:06:38.482
Wait, what?

00:06:38.691 --> 00:06:39.441
Why?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.485
Explanation requested.

00:06:55.499 --> 00:06:58.502
Pulling one small area,
with all my strength,

00:06:58.711 --> 00:07:00.337
resulted in no more than that.

00:07:00.546 --> 00:07:03.591
Constructing the massive Ceremonial
Equipment is currently impossible.

00:07:03.799 --> 00:07:04.633
Indeed.

00:07:04.842 --> 00:07:07.553
Probably because the
Destruction Blade's body

00:07:07.761 --> 00:07:09.972
has blended in with this area.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.600
So it won't be that easy, huh?

00:07:12.808 --> 00:07:14.977
By the way, Specialist
of Everything, that wound...

00:07:15.185 --> 00:07:18.564
It's the Destruction Blade's
Unrestricted Method, Stigma, indeed.

00:07:18.772 --> 00:07:21.567
Didn't we deal with that already?

00:07:21.775 --> 00:07:23.235
Can't you close it?

00:07:23.444 --> 00:07:26.947
The System for removing the
curse no longer works, indeed.

00:07:27.156 --> 00:07:31.368
Most likely, he's improved
the curse somehow, indeed.

00:07:31.577 --> 00:07:34.830
Presently, I am analyzing
which Unrestricted System I carry

00:07:35.039 --> 00:07:37.708
that may have some effect, indeed.

00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:41.629
While it's fortunate that
the wound doesn't spread,

00:07:41.837 --> 00:07:44.089
I believe we should
avoid further injuries at all costs.

00:07:44.298 --> 00:07:45.924
Emphasize dodging.

00:07:46.133 --> 00:07:48.844
It's not gonna be easy,

00:07:49.053 --> 00:07:50.804
avoiding that monster's strikes.

00:07:51.013 --> 00:07:51.889
Yeah...

00:07:52.097 --> 00:07:54.892
The problem is whether
we can use our original plan

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.019
without the Ceremonial Equipment.

00:07:57.227 --> 00:08:01.023
We should deploy
Qadesh's Blood Seal regardless.

00:08:01.231 --> 00:08:01.982
He's here.

00:08:02.191 --> 00:08:03.609
Spread out!

00:08:06.111 --> 00:08:07.529
A dream?

00:08:07.988 --> 00:08:10.908
Yes, it may be a dream.

00:08:11.116 --> 00:08:12.785
Walking this path,

00:08:12.993 --> 00:08:15.287
I have often thought to myself,

00:08:15.496 --> 00:08:17.748
that should I wake, it all would disappear.

00:08:17.956 --> 00:08:21.377
It could all be an ephemeral illusion,

00:08:21.585 --> 00:08:24.838
dreamt over millennia of slumber.

00:08:25.923 --> 00:08:28.467
But this is no dream.

00:08:28.676 --> 00:08:30.886
All of this is here,

00:08:31.095 --> 00:08:32.721
and real.

00:08:34.348 --> 00:08:36.475
Long have I made you all wait.

00:08:36.684 --> 00:08:38.310
But that ends now.

00:08:38.519 --> 00:08:40.813
Rather, it begins.

00:08:45.943 --> 00:08:48.529
Awaken me from my slumber.

00:08:48.737 --> 00:08:50.155
Yes.

00:08:52.825 --> 00:08:54.827
Well done.

00:09:50.048 --> 00:09:53.218
"Words of a Vow"

00:09:53.469 --> 00:09:55.304
I'm so sorry!

00:09:58.098 --> 00:09:58.932
I never expected

00:09:59.141 --> 00:10:02.644
enemy reinforcements to
arrive so quickly from the west.

00:10:02.853 --> 00:10:05.355
It is not your fault.

00:10:05.564 --> 00:10:07.107
No one here

00:10:07.316 --> 00:10:10.277
predicted this.

00:10:10.486 --> 00:10:12.446
Unfortunately, unexpected reinforcements

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:15.073
have struck us from the side.

00:10:16.492 --> 00:10:20.329
VVar never goes as one expects.

00:10:21.705 --> 00:10:26.627
The pursuit forces we
tasked with delaying the enemy

00:10:26.835 --> 00:10:30.839
have proved ineffective, then.

00:10:31.048 --> 00:10:34.551
We even deployed Sale and Chiara, but...

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.428
It appears that

00:10:36.637 --> 00:10:38.972
their tricks were better than ours.

00:10:40.432 --> 00:10:41.475
All that's left are

00:10:41.683 --> 00:10:45.479
the forces we sent to stop their armies
to the east, holed up on Mount Tanigawa.

00:10:45.687 --> 00:10:49.399
If the enemy breaks through there,
we'll have nowhere to run.

00:10:50.901 --> 00:10:53.403
If we worry over our escape route now,

00:10:53.612 --> 00:10:55.531
victory is impossible.

00:10:55.739 --> 00:10:57.157
But...

00:11:00.118 --> 00:11:01.662
This is horrible.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:05.666
We cannot afford to be stuck
here at such a critical time.

00:11:05.874 --> 00:11:08.043
I'd love to break through right now...

00:11:08.252 --> 00:11:11.213
If we weren't up against that
madman, Mikalojus!

00:11:11.421 --> 00:11:14.466
That's why they stationed them here.

00:11:14.675 --> 00:11:16.552
If the blizzard vanished,

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.929
we could use my Daim6n.

00:11:19.137 --> 00:11:22.140
If that natural disaster the
Strategist spoke of,

00:11:22.349 --> 00:11:24.351
when she said,

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.603
"Be cautious but hopeful,"

00:11:26.812 --> 00:11:27.646
were to occur,

00:11:27.855 --> 00:11:29.940
it would momentarily distract them...

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.613
The Supreme Throne, Hecate,

00:11:36.822 --> 00:11:38.615
addresses Your Highness.

00:11:38.824 --> 00:11:41.285
With my great staff, Trigon,

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:44.079
let your bonds be undone.

00:11:46.832 --> 00:11:48.333
Let them be undone.

00:11:49.459 --> 00:11:51.086
Let them be undone...

00:11:51.962 --> 00:11:53.589
Let them be undone...

00:11:55.591 --> 00:11:57.217
Let them be undone!

00:12:11.565 --> 00:12:13.400
Splendid!

00:12:17.529 --> 00:12:18.780
Well done,

00:12:18.989 --> 00:12:20.657
my servants, Trinity!

00:12:20.866 --> 00:12:22.868
My pride and joy!

00:12:27.331 --> 00:12:29.958
Creator God,

00:12:30.167 --> 00:12:32.836
my comrade and fellow deity.

00:12:33.045 --> 00:12:34.421
I shall now return

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.173
to the hands of Shana,

00:12:36.381 --> 00:12:38.717
the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:12:38.926 --> 00:12:40.427
Yuji Sakai,

00:12:40.636 --> 00:12:43.013
is this to be our last meeting?

00:12:43.221 --> 00:12:44.514
Thank you.

00:12:44.723 --> 00:12:47.559
But you don't need to worry, Alastor.

00:12:48.727 --> 00:12:49.895
Indeed.

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:52.356
We follow the path together.

00:12:53.523 --> 00:12:56.526
We'll see each other at
the Palace of the Stars soon.

00:12:59.738 --> 00:13:02.908
My task here is finished.

00:13:04.201 --> 00:13:06.787
Now, it is time to return!

00:13:11.208 --> 00:13:12.250
<i>Master'?</i>

00:13:12.459 --> 00:13:14.294
I've returned, Shana.

00:13:14.503 --> 00:13:16.797
I knew you'd make it this far.

00:13:18.006 --> 00:13:19.007
Shall we go?

00:13:19.216 --> 00:13:20.634
Let's go!

00:13:32.729 --> 00:13:35.899
Nothing goes the way you expect.

00:13:36.108 --> 00:13:37.609
So what shall I do?

00:13:37.818 --> 00:13:40.028
I shall open the way by force.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.305
Take that! And that! And that!

00:14:10.434 --> 00:14:13.145
Your strength and spirit are to be praised,

00:14:13.353 --> 00:14:17.441
but I do not wish my blade broken.

00:14:22.529 --> 00:14:23.947
She still had such power...

00:14:24.156 --> 00:14:25.782
Words unnecessary.

00:14:34.207 --> 00:14:35.625
Activate.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:41.798
Deploying Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:14:46.553 --> 00:14:47.471
Yeah.

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:51.767
I can't do anything as
crazy as the Chanter of Elegies.

00:14:51.975 --> 00:14:52.684
Indeed.

00:14:52.893 --> 00:14:57.606
If it's merely a question of isolating
the inside of the circle from without,

00:14:59.066 --> 00:15:01.485
Let's fire off a big one!

00:15:01.693 --> 00:15:04.821
I didn't honestly think
you'd expect to defeat me

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.615
using the same tactic.

00:15:07.908 --> 00:15:12.120
Loss causes such
unpleasant fruit to later ripen.

00:15:12.329 --> 00:15:13.705
I'll take him out first!

00:15:13.914 --> 00:15:14.623
Wait, Rebecca!

00:15:14.831 --> 00:15:16.666
Look around you!

00:15:20.003 --> 00:15:21.963
The gap between the two worlds?

00:15:22.172 --> 00:15:25.258
By cutting it off from me,
its control structure,

00:15:25.467 --> 00:15:29.221
the body that blended into the
area cannot maintain control of its power.

00:15:29.429 --> 00:15:32.015
It's begun dispersing,
destroying the land.

00:15:32.224 --> 00:15:34.101
If you continue to seal me here,

00:15:34.309 --> 00:15:37.521
the Path of Pilgrimage will disintegrate.

00:15:37.729 --> 00:15:39.564
Old man, stop the Unrestricted Method!

00:15:39.773 --> 00:15:40.732
This is bad!

00:15:40.941 --> 00:15:41.525
Yeah.

00:15:41.733 --> 00:15:44.820
Even if we sacrifice ourselves
to cut off this path,

00:15:45.028 --> 00:15:48.615
there's no guarantee the
Snake will be caught in it, too!

00:15:58.416 --> 00:16:00.544
It seems you came with a plan,

00:16:00.752 --> 00:16:03.004
but now that's ruined.

00:16:04.381 --> 00:16:06.133
Even if you devise a new one,

00:16:06.341 --> 00:16:08.927
who will die in the meantime?

00:16:10.512 --> 00:16:12.139
We're not done yet!

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:13.890
What?

00:16:16.434 --> 00:16:18.061
Wilhelmina!

00:16:22.649 --> 00:16:25.443
Take this, blow up, and burn to ash!

00:16:35.871 --> 00:16:37.289
Nice!

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:42.085
What?

00:16:42.294 --> 00:16:43.712
What happened?

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:44.754
Yeah...

00:16:44.963 --> 00:16:46.965
That can't be...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:56.641
A Rinne prepared
by the three-eyed woman.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.270
Her predictions are unpleasantly accurate.

00:17:01.688 --> 00:17:03.523
Only one remains.

00:17:33.845 --> 00:17:34.346
Master.

00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:35.889
I know.

00:17:36.097 --> 00:17:37.641
That is my guest.

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.602
Yuji Sakai...

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.020
<i>'an.</i>

00:17:43.021 --> 00:17:44.940
I'll fight the body containing him,

00:17:45.148 --> 00:17:46.775
hold back the others.

00:17:48.652 --> 00:17:50.278
Soaring Flame!

00:17:59.788 --> 00:18:01.539
Master...

00:18:01.748 --> 00:18:03.124
I told you.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:05.418
That is my guest.

00:18:08.296 --> 00:18:09.130
Shana“.

00:18:09.339 --> 00:18:11.091
Why have you done this?

00:18:11.299 --> 00:18:13.510
Are you here to fight?

00:18:13.718 --> 00:18:15.762
My wish to live with you...

00:18:15.971 --> 00:18:17.931
My vow to protect you...

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:20.934
Neither of them was a lie.

00:18:21.142 --> 00:18:24.062
Yet you would stand
in my way, as a Flame Haze,

00:18:24.271 --> 00:18:25.355
just another tool?

00:18:25.563 --> 00:18:26.982
I will.

00:18:27.774 --> 00:18:29.943
The Grand Order you
serve is being brought about

00:18:30.151 --> 00:18:33.905
by out-of-control Denizens
with the power of a god.

00:18:34.114 --> 00:18:37.075
The Creator God can change the very world

00:18:37.284 --> 00:18:39.703
to suit his will.

00:18:39.911 --> 00:18:41.037
Forever.

00:18:41.246 --> 00:18:42.455
It's possible

00:18:42.664 --> 00:18:45.750
that his manifestation
will threaten the world itself.

00:18:45.959 --> 00:18:48.378
And so he must be destroyed?

00:18:50.463 --> 00:18:52.507
After Yuji left Misaki City,

00:18:52.716 --> 00:18:54.509
someone told me something.

00:18:54.718 --> 00:18:56.886
That it was time
to stop deceiving myself.

00:18:57.095 --> 00:18:59.931
That it was time for
me to become one with me.

00:19:01.099 --> 00:19:03.268
I thought I knew what she meant...

00:19:03.476 --> 00:19:05.395
That at some point, the Flame Haze me

00:19:05.603 --> 00:19:08.732
and the other me had
become two different people.

00:19:09.524 --> 00:19:12.277
But I was wrong.

00:19:12.485 --> 00:19:16.281
When I talked to someone else
about it, they told me,

00:19:16.489 --> 00:19:19.367
"There aren't two of you. There's only one."

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:24.080
At the time, I didn't understand.

00:19:24.289 --> 00:19:25.707
And ever since I met Yuji,

00:19:25.915 --> 00:19:29.336
I've unconsciously pretended
not to understand.

00:19:29.544 --> 00:19:31.504
I didn't want to fight you.

00:19:31.713 --> 00:19:34.341
And I didn't want to accept
that I didn't want to fight you.

00:19:34.549 --> 00:19:36.426
That sad little reason created

00:19:36.634 --> 00:19:38.470
a me who had to fight

00:19:38.678 --> 00:19:40.638
and a me who didn't want to.

00:19:40.847 --> 00:19:44.184
I was running away from
having to choose between them.

00:19:45.435 --> 00:19:48.730
And now, I possess the
strongest Unrestricted Method,

00:19:48.938 --> 00:19:51.524
which allows me to overcome that fear.

00:19:51.733 --> 00:19:53.943
I've gained a great power,

00:19:54.152 --> 00:19:56.071
which let me come here and fight.

00:19:56.279 --> 00:19:57.739
And by meeting you,

00:19:57.947 --> 00:20:00.075
I've gained something
which will let me settle everything.

00:20:00.283 --> 00:20:02.077
Settle everything?

00:20:02.285 --> 00:20:03.703
Yes.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.463
<i>Yum...</i>

00:20:13.671 --> 00:20:14.964
<i>'an.</i>

00:20:16.216 --> 00:20:18.051
I love you.

00:20:19.677 --> 00:20:24.849
<i>I must be dreaming tonight</i>

00:20:24.849 --> 00:20:25.100
Love is the strongest
Unrestricted Method!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:30.271
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:20:30.271 --> 00:20:30.480
I suppose you learned
this from he who raised you...

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.273
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:20:32.273 --> 00:20:33.650
With this, the strongest
Unrestricted Method, I will challenge you,

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:37.654
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:20:37.654 --> 00:20:38.071
Yes.

00:20:38.279 --> 00:20:40.323
I will not kill you.

00:20:40.532 --> 00:20:42.992
It isn't that I don't want to kill you. I will not.

00:20:42.992 --> 00:20:47.038
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:20:47.038 --> 00:20:49.374
And if the Snake of the Festival
possesses you, I'll take him down too.

00:20:49.374 --> 00:20:52.544
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:20:52.544 --> 00:20:53.837
And then I'll search for an answer

00:20:53.837 --> 00:20:54.462
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:20:54.462 --> 00:20:57.715
as to what you should or
shouldn't do with your power,

00:20:57.715 --> 00:21:00.677
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:00.885 --> 00:21:01.803
Yes.

00:21:02.011 --> 00:21:05.056
I should've just resolved
myself to that difficult task.

00:21:05.056 --> 00:21:07.350
<i>"I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.268
That is who I am as a Flame Haze!

00:21:08.476 --> 00:21:09.853
Impossible.

00:21:10.061 --> 00:21:13.481
Such a convenient conclusion
would never be allowed.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.275
You would mock the desire

00:21:15.483 --> 00:21:17.986
I've held for millennia
with a child's fantasies?

00:21:17.986 --> 00:21:19.404
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:21:19.404 --> 00:21:20.947
It doesn't matter
whether it's allowed or not.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:24.659
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the fatality of solitude
(Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:21:24.659 --> 00:21:25.201
as the path we must walk together.

00:21:25.201 --> 00:21:27.829
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:21:27.829 --> 00:21:28.955
For the day we can share

00:21:28.955 --> 00:21:31.082
<i>Reflect the moment's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:21:31.082 --> 00:21:32.959
like everyone does.

00:21:32.959 --> 00:21:34.252
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:21:34.419 --> 00:21:37.589
I remember what you once said.

00:21:37.589 --> 00:21:37.839
<i>Is also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:21:38.047 --> 00:21:41.009
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:21:41.009 --> 00:21:41.050
That you mustn't waste
the fact that I was there,

00:21:41.217 --> 00:21:46.973
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:21:46.973 --> 00:21:47.974
was with you.

00:21:47.974 --> 00:21:52.103
<i>Hey, hey if there is no defying
the fate fed before my eyes,</i>

00:21:52.312 --> 00:21:54.272
<i>Then I want to extend myself and "fight with
my own two hands the Creator God alone,</i>

00:21:54.272 --> 00:21:55.523
<i>Then I want to extend myself
and fight with my own two hands</i>

00:21:55.523 --> 00:21:56.774
as the God of Atonement's contractor,

00:21:56.774 --> 00:21:59.277
<i>I believe that you will see
what I'm doing is never wrong for us</i>

00:21:59.277 --> 00:21:59.319
I will use the
Tenpajyosai without hesitation.

00:21:59.486 --> 00:22:01.946
<i>That's right, from now on,
I fear nothing "I'll believe"</i>

00:22:01.946 --> 00:22:02.530
Because Yuji is there,

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:05.241
<i>“I remember" That fact teaches...</i>

00:22:05.241 --> 00:22:07.452
I'm not acting simply as a Flame Haze.

00:22:07.452 --> 00:22:08.578
...me how to live

00:22:08.578 --> 00:22:10.914
Because of who we are now,

00:22:10.914 --> 00:22:12.123
<i>These unrequited feelings are strong enough</i>

00:22:12.123 --> 00:22:15.835
we can choose a new path,
even a child's fantasy!

00:22:15.835 --> 00:22:19.130
<i>That is why I want
you to remember something</i>

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:19.923
...dangerous.

00:22:19.923 --> 00:22:21.216
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:21.424 --> 00:22:28.723
<i>Even the scabs of tears are
afterimages that we should love</i>

00:22:28.723 --> 00:22:29.140
Who knows? But this is interesting.

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:30.308
<i>(So now that you & I)</i>

00:22:30.308 --> 00:22:31.935
I can't help but laugh.

00:22:31.935 --> 00:22:33.520
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:33.728 --> 00:22:37.148
<i>“I'll believe..." This determination is
engraved into my heart (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:37.148 --> 00:22:40.360
I've thought so many times,
but never as much as now.

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:40.485
<i>In the hellfire of war,</i>

00:22:40.568 --> 00:22:44.322
When you boast this much, it becomes
as good a reason to fight as any.

00:22:44.322 --> 00:22:45.323
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:45.323 --> 00:22:46.074
It isn't boasting.

00:22:46.074 --> 00:22:47.283
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:47.283 --> 00:22:48.243
I'll make it real.

00:22:48.243 --> 00:22:50.787
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:50.787 --> 00:22:54.582
What is the nature of your Grand Order,
which threatens to change the world?

00:22:54.582 --> 00:22:57.544
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:22:57.544 --> 00:22:59.587
Weren't you going to make me
do as you said, after you defeated me?

00:22:59.587 --> 00:23:00.547
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:00.755 --> 00:23:04.175
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:04.175 --> 00:23:04.217
There is a time to speak of everything.

00:23:04.384 --> 00:23:07.387
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:07.387 --> 00:23:07.595
If you wish me to speak of it now...

00:23:07.595 --> 00:23:14.269
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist (I'm dedicating
my body and soul to carving myself into today)</i>

00:23:14.269 --> 00:23:16.771
All right, I will!

00:23:16.771 --> 00:23:22.986
<i>“I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:25.905 --> 00:23:27.115
Sabrac and Wilhelmina.

00:23:27.323 --> 00:23:28.366
Khamsin and Rebecca.

00:23:28.575 --> 00:23:29.450
Shana and Yuji.

00:23:29.659 --> 00:23:31.536
Amidst their battles,
their feelings clash.

00:23:31.744 --> 00:23:34.497
And the Snake of the Festival
leaves the Path of Pilgrimage.

00:23:34.706 --> 00:23:36.833
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:37.041 --> 00:23:39.794
"From Rift to Rift."
